    "| MAP | mean of APs | Comprehensive ranking quality | Benchmark comparisons |\n",
    "| MRR | mean 1/rank_first | Speed of finding first answer | Q&A systems |\n",
    "| nDCG | DCG/IDCG | Graded relevance + position | Modern search evaluation |"
